  "next_step": "With all power disconnected, retain the factory 35 cm clip cable intact for the first diagnostic change and minimize only the eight added Dupont wires using a properly terminated spare set, about 5 cm where practical (5\u201310 cm is a practical target for the jumpers only; exact length matching unnecessary). This leaves roughly 40\u201345 cm total cable, so it does not establish a short overall path or guarantee a fix. Preserve clip seating and original wire set, then use the prepared bounded 64-KiB repeatability test before any new full reads. Cable length is a plausible contributor, not a proven cause. No voltage increase, reset jumper, majority-vote restore image or firmware write.",
